    "steps": [
      "Melt the butter in a large nonstick skillet on medium until it begins to foam.",
      "Break the eggs into the pan, leaving space between them. Cook about 3 minutes, until the whites are firm; cook a little longer for set yolks.",
      "Slide the eggs onto plates and sprinkle them with salt and black pepper.",
